Assess whether forwarding third-party UI is needed beyond proxy-owned admin screens. Audit ToolInfo metadata, resource routing, aliased tools, structured results, output protection and search-mode constraints. Record proceed/defer with a concrete compatibility contract. Default to defer unless selected for implementation; if deferred, cancel the downstream optional tasks with rationale. Acceptance: decision explicitly distinguishes upstream forwarding from completed admin UI. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
